    {
      "page_title": "Notification APIs, Dedup and Metrics",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "5. Key APIs",
          "items": [
            "Internal `POST /notify` with event, user, template",
            "User `PUT /preferences` for channels and promo opt-out",
            "Template service fills per-event variables, by locale",
            "Provider feedback deletes **stale** DeviceToken rows"
          ],
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "6. Idempotency and Consistency",
          "items": [
            "Dedup key: `order_id + event`, unique index",
            "A retried consumer never **double-notifies**",
            "Preferences checked before every promo send",
            "Retry: exponential backoff, then DLQ, then SMS"
          ],
          "ink": "orange"
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "7. Failure Scenarios",
          "items": [
            "FCM outage: critical events fall back to SMS",
            "Token expiry: push fails, token is purged",
            "Restaurant silent 60 s: phone-call fallback",
            "Poison message: parked in the DLQ for replay"
          ],
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "8. Events Published",
          "items": [
            "`NotificationSent` and `NotificationDelivered`",
            "`NotificationFailed` after retries are exhausted",
            "`RestaurantEscalated` when the call fallback fires"
          ],
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "9. Key Metrics",
          "items": [
            "Delivery rate above **97%**",
            "Event-to-notification p99 under **3 s**",
            "Opt-out rate, tracked per campaign"
          ],
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "10. Design: push first, SMS only as fallback (cost)",
            "Restaurant alert is louder: ring repeats until accept",
            "Promo is batched and rate-limited; transactional never waits",
            "Keep the in-app inbox as the always-stored record"
          ],
          "style": "check",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "Cost tip",
          "text": "SMS costs ~Rs 0.15 each, so reserve it for critical events."
        }
      ],
      "hero": "bell",
      "subtitle": "Food Delivery App"
